{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "2620fe0537e4c3e238f8a14c8ec3c2a9db6e14cf5db7772184a48218577245da", "ja": "野々原茜のプリン教室", "zh": "野野原茜的布丁教室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a889502b76457b8441ef02cc80a24aff499a4dd8d3db6f036acdd2ca7ce974e0", "ja": "志保が元気がなかったのは、ホームシックが\n原因だったらしい。志保の弟がプリンが好き\nだと聞き、帰ったら作ってあげたらと提案す\nる茜。エレナとプロデューサーの言葉もあっ\nて、志保の顔に笑顔が戻った。", "zh": "志保无精打采的原因，似乎是想家了。\n茜得知志保的弟弟喜欢布丁后，建议她\n回去之后做给弟弟吃。再加上艾莲娜和\n制作人的开导，志保的脸上重现了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "96d32555a56d83b11bca370bb808c78e6e7cc7ffc489c8c1dbae05cb7646d7f1", "ja": "（志保も茜もエレナも、プリンを前に神妙な顔を\nしている。さて、どこから話そうかな……）", "zh": "（志保、茜和艾蕾娜，面对着布丁都露出严肃的表情。嗯，该从哪里说起呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "b39b2a9727c923775ff26ffa6ee7293ecdec3e5598cd1addb6a93f35e460b8fc", "ja": "シホ、プリン嫌いなノ？\n食べられないとか？", "zh": "志保不喜欢布丁吗？是因为吃不了之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "424c41b1be3437a6dc94f26e5836133f8bba830a01947862d54156c6912f7229", "ja": "そんなことないです。\n家ではよく……弟と、食べたりしますし。", "zh": "不是那回事。在家也经常……和弟弟一起吃的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "e2b1220fa49587ea90fc1845d8bf1da42a50076448bc2b9cfa31ed731831c101", "ja": "そっか、しほりん弟くんいるんだったよね！\n陸くんだっけ。元気かニャ？", "zh": "这样啊，志保有个弟弟对吧！\n是叫陆君来着？他还好吗喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "9046bdcdcb657abb17b781d2577a2925aac98e5d8679102e7075b1e4af2f600b", "ja": "母のメールを見る限り、元気そうです。", "zh": "从妈妈发来的邮件来看，他好像挺精神的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "d6097791f11b987528042879019b6b7bad9c1e934f5cc6fc61228dc95d3a0f37", "ja": "撮影の間、家族と離れてるの、寂しいよネ。\nワタシも、家族に会いたいな～。", "zh": "拍摄期间和家人分开，一定很寂寞吧。\n我也想见家人了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7dde33d694962da87fd6b97d5cb9ad989f9f93427594131d8054e5d561c3549f", "ja": "志保。違っていたらごめんだけど……\nもしかして、ホームシックなのか？", "zh": "志保。如果猜错了很抱歉……\n你该不会是想家了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "5626e9ab2b359e6961a8e6fd642a8445b39885b7c2d0aa09e14167ac5b258ee1", "ja": "！！　ち、違います！\n別に、そんなんじゃ……。", "zh": "！！不、不是的！才不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "188f292cf5186cfe6f8254b1276c5ee4a15b94f7b2a346f0c900f3dfdf16eb39", "ja": "あー！！　そっか！\nシホ、それで元気なかったんだネ……。", "zh": "啊——！！原来如此！\n志保就是因为这样才没精神的呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "00e20da4c58f408706a720a9377df04628eaad30d14808ff2f83da0c2123afaf", "ja": "なるほどなるほど……ホームシック、いいよ！\n別に恥ずかしがる事じゃないよ、しほりん！", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此……想家了啊，没问题！\n这又不是什么丢人的事，小志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "d5e49cfe6b96c4ca7622428e2068bee3437f605a59164f530cc20b7014fffb97", "ja": "茜ちゃんは今回の撮影、合宿みたいで楽しいけど。\nでもやっぱり、お家最高って気持ちはあります！", "zh": "小茜觉得这次拍摄像集训一样，很开心。不过果然还是有种“家里最好”的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "6bc43e0e6deca4852469ebc1a7c8901346f8789ee374989b4343b40554c1d9ef", "ja": "……プリン……弟が、好きなんです。", "zh": "……布丁……我弟弟很喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "7b0cd3b6966f2e10089baeeb7b7a1598e0a6cdb3dd334fe85d0ad70e54ee4051", "ja": "リクくんが？", "zh": "是莉久喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "f227cd4870a30e2143648542b39a039798bd45825e571d3b7cc5dd3a29df677f", "ja": "……泊りがけの仕事、初めてじゃないですし。\n気にしてるつもりはなかったんですけど。", "zh": "……在外过夜的工作，又不是第一次接了。\n我本来以为自己并不在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "4de23e1cd425df2c9f086b1d43fb3c29e503242ebc794c572122393e9888869a", "ja": "綺麗な景色を、母にも見せたいと思ったり。\n弟にも、おいしいご飯、食べさせてあげたいとか……。", "zh": "有时也会想让妈妈看看美丽的景色。也想让弟弟吃上美味的饭菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "9faabd444a21bcf1da3507c21a2c0db0d30d8cb8c4ce31a273ce5d97a9cbbe77", "ja": "そんなふうに、急に家族のことを思い出してしまって。\n仕事に集中しなくちゃいけないのに……。", "zh": "不知怎么的，突然就想起家人了。\n明明必须集中精力工作才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "60238939c6ab2a7ff01b24423aac4ea3119f267928f7369ea16f58c75a8dda9a", "ja": "（人一倍家族思いな志保の事だ。\nお母さんや弟さんの事を思い出すのは当然だろう）", "zh": "（志保可是比常人更重视家人。会想起妈妈和弟弟，也是理所当然的吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "55c276ad10abc3050b0f957f7df83a674319fb3b50ebe997d9453e7f0b6e5710", "ja": "（それで仕事に集中できないのを、\n気にしていたんだな）", "zh": "所以，你是在担心自己没法集中精力工作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "83a842eef176ca3f15cbb51dd94a4a1db31750b0422af2ffc45e44fbddbc7c85", "ja": "ねえ、シホ。\nやっぱり、ワタシたちと一緒に、プリン食べよう？", "zh": "那个，志保。\n果然还是和我们一起吃布丁吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "4cb54b83c686ae173fed1293f3260491af3dc4bd108f376b4aee5eb9cb2ee897", "ja": "それで、帰ったらリクくんにも、プリンを\n作ってあげるといいヨ。すっごくおいしかったって♪", "zh": "这样吧，回去后也给陆君做布丁吧。就说真的特别好吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "138851ec05b062fe1ad17cf32be475f4a0780bb9cbb222b823bd45430d67d09f", "ja": "エレナちゃん……天才！？　そうだよ、しほりん！\nつまりこれは、陸くんのために必要な味見なのだ！", "zh": "艾莲娜……天才！？对哦，志保琳！\n也就是说，这是为了陆君所必需的试吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "2e237186d6cdbef51cd9b66f7c8d51524f99e7728fa1add52b538ec6d2515324", "ja": "味見って……ふふっ。\nなんですか、それ。", "zh": "试吃什么的……呵呵。\n这算什么理由啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "11a5ae84edf10b0811a8054f72843f1bc3ee61cadc1fd3aa01b323a2e0e81d4d", "ja": "いいじゃないか、志保。それに、お姉さんが仕事を\n楽しんでくれていたほうが、弟さんも嬉しいと思うよ。", "zh": "有什么关系嘛，志保。而且要是看到姐姐工作得\n很开心，你弟弟也肯定会高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ed7a06ca74fb67f7ea76509c59f531da8e73dce284128649cadd6f1695c63f7e", "ja": "帰ったら弟さんに、たくさんお土産話を聞かせて\nあげるといい。一緒にプリンを食べながら。", "zh": "回去之后，多讲讲旅行的见闻给弟弟听\n就好了。一边一起吃布丁一边聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "a37e83cf9b422d39ef290e601cac05c5bdeb522f465a22cb999eeaafa150cdae", "ja": "さすが茜ちゃんの{$P$}ちゃん！\nいいコト言った！", "zh": "不愧是小茜的{$P$}！\n说得好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "26a4f7fc92613ac1d2afe442a07b9a46849f404800c1dd7ca4d3196756d79aa3", "ja": "わかりました。……茜さん、エレナさん。\n撮影が終わったら、作り方、教えてもらえますか。", "zh": "明白了。……茜小姐、艾蕾娜小姐。\n拍摄结束后，可以教我怎么做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "04471102165e12ab32378f7f2b9bdb97f3cbe245486ca9e9a63967797a68af7e", "ja": "もちろん！\nあのね、すっごく簡単だから！", "zh": "当然啦！\n那个啊，因为真的超级简单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "a184083722c032e1551df891fbd74e91431e16fdc2e1018da97281ca9a34e11a", "ja": "うん！　簡単だけど、すっごくおいしいからネ♪\nワタシも、帰ったら家族に作ってあげようっと！", "zh": "嗯！虽然简单，但特别好吃哦♪\n我回去后也要做给家人吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "8756cfdfe7b982ad9f5fb9156bd602698cefbd997189be76f609204f7f6cc61d", "ja": "（茜とエレナの笑顔につられるように笑顔になった\n志保が、プリンを食べる。……よかったな）", "zh": "（志保仿佛也被茜和艾蕾娜的笑容感染，露出了笑容，吃起了布丁。……太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "eaa4c0884c443fbe296e2ef07ad6971039c4cd576ad7954c71f5e210361aa558", "ja": "（作品をいいものにしたいという気持ちは、みんな\n同じはず……今は最終日まで、走りきるしかない！）", "zh": "（大家都抱着想把作品做好的心情……现在只能坚持到最后一天了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "60c4a3dc8a57a537a0489e1baa5501787a9322006de3ee511418dc1754be429b", "ja": "ね？　だから言ったでしょ。あの子達と\n{$P$}がいれば、大丈夫だって。", "zh": "看吧？我就说了吧。有那些孩子们和\n{$P$}在，就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "a779ccf75238d914b1165dbcce1277ff4e4e17c649c1e271c7cad2e5ea7ca536", "ja": "そうみたいですわね。\n……ふふ、心配して損しましたわ。", "zh": "看来确实是这样呢。\n……呵呵，看来是我白担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_05_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "3a5923212e8868b20b2e12a70a6c9f6db08f95a124757fb139d06e9f7f80fada", "ja": "はぁ……まったく。\n相変わらず、世話が焼けるんだから。", "zh": "唉……真是的。\n还是一如既往地让人操心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
